  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the enslaved African (lion)",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the 'us' in the bottom text, which refers to the enslaved African person being depicted as the lion. The meme uses the visual of the lion being cared for by a 'master' to represent the historical experience of enslaved Africans. The user sees themselves as the 'us' in this dehumanizing scenario, identifying with the enslaved person's position of subjugation and dependence on the 'master'. This projection is implicit through the use of 'us' and the visual mapping of the enslaved African onto the lion.",
